WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:05.340
[EU STRATEGY
ON CHILDREN’S RIGHTS]

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.000
[CHILD PARTICIPATION
IN POLICY-MAKING]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.200
[30% OF THE WORLD POPULATION
ARE CHILDREN]

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.580
We do not want to keep
growing up in a society

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:18.580
where profit is more important
than helping one another.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.620
Children want to be heard.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.600
[COMBATING VIOLENCE]

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.460
[50% OF CHILDREN WORLDWIDE
ARE VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE]

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.780
I was five years old
when the conflict first started.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.100
The airstrikes started
hitting our area

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:37.180
and we would not go outside
due to the fierce bombing.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.860
[ONLINE PROTECTION]

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:43.260
[27% OF CHILDREN IN THE EU EXPERIENCE
DISTURBING CONTENT ONLINE ONCE A MONTH]

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:48.820
For me bullying is an act of physical,
psychological or verbal violence.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.660
We have to understand
that these types of situations

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.320
are more and more frequent nowadays
and that is of a great concern.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.000
[CHILD FRIENDLY JUSTICE]

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.900
[33% OF ASYLUM APPLICATIONS
TO THE EU IN 2020 WERE CHILDREN]

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.200
[SOCIO-ECONOMIC INCLUSION]

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.660
[22% OF CHILDREN IN THE EU ARE AT RISK
OF POVERTY OR SOCIAL EXCLUSION]

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.060
Children do not just want to survive,

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:12.860
they want to live,
they want to thrive.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:18.060
We want not to be judged
by our age, our sexuality, our ethnicity,

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.180
but by the beauty of our dreams.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.350
[GLOBAL DIMENSION]

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.980
[10% OF CHILDREN WORLDWIDE
ARE FORCED INTO LABOUR]

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.940
Hardly a day passes without
a child being abused.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:30.620
Children given out for child labour
are seen in the streets,

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.700
having no place
to lay their heads.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:36.700
It is my heart’s desire
that all of this will come to an end

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.420
and we will achieve a world
free of violence and harm to children.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.000
Thank you.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.820
[EU STRATEGY
ON CHILDREN’S RIGHTS]

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.800
[SPECIALTHANKS
TO THE WORLD VISION]

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.300
[AND ALL THE CHILDREN
WHO MADE THIS VIDEO POSSIBLE]

